  "bodyHash": "WbsQikG879Q=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神秘燈籠讓你能駕馭光明的力量！使用燈籠製造台製作特殊類型的燈籠，它們擁有各種效果，能幫助你守護基地。還在等什麼，準備好迎接魔法吧！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用燈籠製造台將普通的原版燈籠注入特殊力量。將催化劑放入製造台，最後將原版燈籠方塊放在頂部，即可創造出新燈籠。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每種燈籠的配方和資訊可在 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">JEI</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 和 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">REI</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 中找到。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">生命燈籠：讓燈籠周圍的作物生長更快。催化劑：雞蛋、西瓜、金蘋果、甘蔗、骨粉</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">野性燈籠：透過生成火花照亮周圍巨大區域。當區域被照亮且生成足夠火花後，燈籠會消失。催化劑：螢光石、南瓜燈、火焰彈、烈焰粉、金錠</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">愛戀燈籠：讓附近的生物墜入愛河。催化劑：鑽石、兔子腳、金胡蘿蔔、甜菜根、生命燈籠、蜂蜜瓶</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">哀嚎燈籠：靠近時會哭泣，再靠近則會尖叫並施加噁心效果。催化劑：幽靈之淚、扭曲根、打火石、河豚、墨囊</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">極寒燈籠：減慢附近生物和玩家的速度，並熄滅燃燒的生物。催化劑：蜘蛛網、雪球、冰磚、石英</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">輝耀燈籠：將附近的動物直接轉化為經驗值。催化劑：界伏殼、紙、雪球、幻翼膜</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">守護燈籠：推開所有除了玩家以外的生物。催化劑：扭曲蕈菇、河豚、鐵門、黑曜石</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">禁錮燈籠：將所有除了玩家以外的生物限制在區域內。催化劑：守護燈籠、釣竿、蜘蛛網、鎖鏈</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零燈籠：在周圍區域施加凋零效果。催化劑：凋零玫瑰、靈魂砂、煙火之星、煤炭</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">雲霧燈籠：在周圍區域施加緩降效果。催化劑：幻翼膜、靈魂火把、雪塊、白色羊毛</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需在客戶端與伺服器端安裝</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC 與 NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援，可直接在遊戲中使用模組選單進行配置（Fabric 需安裝 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 開發）。請注意，在舊版 Minecraft 中還需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用外部文字編輯器手動配置，所有檔案位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 資料夾，命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，依配置類型而定。並非所有模組都具備所有類型配置檔。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Playelectro\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Playelectro</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 最初以 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magical-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Magical Lanterns</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 之名創建此模組。神秘燈籠是針對現代 Minecraft 的移植版本，進行了多項優化、修復與全面革新。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sheep-variety\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sheepvariety/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-windows\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwindows/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stylisheffects/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"极速下载\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-invasion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-plaques\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mobplaques/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"极速下载\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></",
